  "body": "Safari is currently the only user agent that clears the browsing context name upon cross-origin navigation of a non-auxiliary top-level browsing context and doesn't seem to restore it when going back in history.\r\n\r\nFirefox also doesn't store browsing context name in session history and we'd rather not add that.\r\n\r\ncc @bakulf @cdumez ",
